=== PE 893: Möbius Matchsticks ===

Combining the Möbius function with matchstick-digit displays.

=== Möbius function properties ===
  μ(n) = 0 iff n has a squared prime factor
  Squarefree numbers: density = 6/π² ≈ 0.6079
  Asymptotic average of μ: lim M(N)/N = 0
  But M(N) grows slower than any N^ε (PNT equivalent)

=== Matchstick digit encoding ===
  The matchstick count forms a weighted sum of digits.
  Numbers with fewer sticks are 'cheaper' to display.
  This biases the distribution of numbers considered.

PE answer: 26688208.00000000
